ForgeCode (forge) is an AI-enabled pair programmer and autonomous coding agent
for the terminal. It integrates directly with existing development environments
and shells, providing file reading, writing, multi-hunk patching, regex code
search, shell command execution, Git commit generation, MCP client support, and
persistent SQLite conversation history across OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, AWS
Bedrock, and OpenAI-compatible local or remote LLM providers.

This build is 100% JIT-free (pure-Rust regex/grep-regex, rustls, and bundled
SQLite) for strict W^X compliance across OpenBSD, WASM64, and iOS targets.
